OL,3,GNEWSAWoman makes history as UK's new
OL,4,AVatican ambassador
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman from Leicester has become the
OL,7,Ffirst from a minority background to
OL,8,Fbecome the UK's ambassador to Vatican
OL,9,FCity.
OL,11,FTammy Sandhu was born and bred in the
OL,12,Fcity before going on to have a 20-year
OL,13,Fcareer in the UK's diplomatic services,
OL,14,Fincluding postings in Rabat, Brussels,
OL,15,FSan Francisco and Chennai.
OL,17,FHaving spent the past year learning
OL,18,FItalian, the 44-year-old is now living
OL,19,Fin Rome, enjoying the food and
OL,20,Fhospitality - but admitted she still
OL,21,Fmisses a good Leicester curry.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
